  "slug": "broccoli-and-pesto-soup",
  "title": "Broccoli and Pesto Soup",
  "blurb": "A simple Italian-style soup where tender broccoli florets are simmered in chicken broth and finished with pesto for a fresh, herby flavour.",
  "steps": [
    "Cut the broccoli into small florets and peel and chop the stalks into thin slices.",
    "Peel and thinly slice the garlic cloves.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium heat and cook the garlic for one minute until fragrant.",
    "Pour in the chicken stock and water, then add the broccoli stalks and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add the broccoli florets and simmer for 20 minutes until the broccoli is very tender.",
    "Stir in the pesto and season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the soup in bowls with extra pesto on top if you like."
  ],
